---

<Section id="how" aria-labelledby="how-title">
  <Heading id="how-title" eyebrow="How it works">
    The CLI is a channel.<br />The server holds the keys.
    <Fragment slot="lede">
      Your server checks the grant, decrypts, and writes the decision to the audit log. The database only ever holds
      ciphertext (the encrypted values) and wrapped keys: each secret version gets its own key, locked by your master key
      (envelope encryption).
    </Fragment>
  </Heading>
  <Diagram />
</Section>
